  "change_note": "Desktop pairs merged Core main #223–#231 at Pi/PiDurable 1.0.2. Runtime schema, both component manifests and complete reviewed closure are pinned together. Bridge v1.1, occurrence v1.2 and 12 public bridge commands remain unchanged. Core #231 visible-source diagnostics are research-only and excluded from the production closure. Core retains sole authority over Durable recovery/retention, scoped memory, natural intake and material schedule parsing. Missing memory host scope remains held; raw legacy memory is not promoted. Exact G1 grants retain canonical source, claim and persistent budget checks. G2/G3/G4 Live remain off by default; G5 relationships and unverified materials/term attribution are not promoted. external_send=false. Source pairing does not constitute installation verification."
